    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Selling Point</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform ninjutsu by tying seals with your own hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most important features of this game is that the camera recognizes the marks made by the player's hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can experience the experience of activating ninjutsu by quickly making a mark, just like a real ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A camera is required to play this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/3e26fc22c2c199448be3b6e77680f7d6.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/3e26fc22c2c199448be3b6e77680f7d6.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/3e26fc22c2c199448be3b6e77680f7d6.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't know how to make a mark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry, we have a friendly tutorial to help you see the hand shape in 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/fee8484f32905f94c63052f2421e7255.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/fee8484f32905f94c63052f2421e7255.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/fee8484f32905f94c63052f2421e7255.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player plays the role of the main character, a novice ninja, who uses the ninjutsu he has acquired to fight battles and explore Japan during the Sengoku Period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/c3a98046d93331f54a378499572978b9.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/c3a98046d93331f54a378499572978b9.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/c3a98046d93331f54a378499572978b9.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based battle between the player and the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's turn has a time limit, and the player can use ninjutsu as many times as he/she wants within the time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the faster a mark is made, the more powerful the ninjutsu will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, the faster you can make a mark, the more advantageous you will be in the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/d5f8ead76538241a04640968a289172f.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/d5f8ead76538241a04640968a289172f.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/d5f8ead76538241a04640968a289172f.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies with various characteristics will appear on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(enemies that counterattack every time they are attacked, enemies whose attacks do not work below a certain damage level, enemies whose attack power increases every turn... and so on),</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's analytical skills and judgment will be tested to determine the characteristics of the enemy and which techniques to use at what timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practicing asceticism (mini-games) at home can increase a player's status for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mini-games are a little different from battles in that they allow the player to experience the play of making marks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/03d991de1c187621b7ddecf1e4241986.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/03d991de1c187621b7ddecf1e4241986.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/03d991de1c187621b7ddecf1e4241986.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/4448c93373f0f7be0e22172ee168ee9d.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/4448c93373f0f7be0e22172ee168ee9d.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/4448c93373f0f7be0e22172ee168ee9d.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Broadcast and Distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All live-streaming and distribution is permitted, including monetized versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Selling Point</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform ninjutsu by tying seals with your own hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most important features of this game is that the camera recognizes the marks made by the player's hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can experience the experience of activating ninjutsu by quickly making a mark, just like a real ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A camera is required to play this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/3e26fc22c2c199448be3b6e77680f7d6.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/3e26fc22c2c199448be3b6e77680f7d6.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/3e26fc22c2c199448be3b6e77680f7d6.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't know how to make a mark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry, we have a friendly tutorial to help you see the hand shape in 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/fee8484f32905f94c63052f2421e7255.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/fee8484f32905f94c63052f2421e7255.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/fee8484f32905f94c63052f2421e7255.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p