ith various characteristics will appear on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(enemies that counterattack every time they are attacked, enemies whose attacks do not work below a certain damage level, enemies whose attack power increases every turn... and so on),</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's analytical skills and judgment will be tested to determine the characteristics of the enemy and which techniques to use at what timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practicing asceticism (mini-games) at home can increase a player's status for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mini-games are a little different from battles in that they allow the player to experience the play of making marks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/03d991de1c187621b7ddecf1e4241986.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/03d991de1c187621b7ddecf1e4241986.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/03d991de1c187621b7ddecf1e4241986.mp4?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/4448c93373f0f7be0e22172ee168ee9d.poster.avif?t=1751283894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/4448c93373f0f7be0e22172ee168ee9d.webm?t=1751283894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438610/extras/4448c93373f0f7be0e22172ee168ee9d.mp4?t=17512838